OL,3,GNEWSADiscovery of hazardous chemicals
OL,4,Ain home shuts roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads remain closed near a house in
OL,7,Fnorth Derbyshire where hazardous
OL,8,Fchemicals "related to photography" were
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FThe chemicals were discovered during a
OL,12,Fhouse clearance at the home of the
OL,13,Fowner who died in non-suspicious
OL,14,Fcircumstances, Derbyshire Police said.
OL,16,FOfficers attended Manchester Road,
OL,17,Fbetween Buxton and Whaley Bridge, at
OL,18,Fabout 11:30 BST on Monday, the force
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
