OL,3,GNEWSADiscovery of hazardous chemicals
OL,4,Ain home shuts roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A5004 Long Hill from Buxton to
OL,7,FWhaley Bridge, Old Road at the junction
OL,8,Fwith Lesser Lane, and the access route
OL,9,Ffrom Elnor Lane to Long Hill, were
OL,10,Fclosed while police and the Army's
OL,11,FExplosive Ordnance Disposal (EOD)
OL,12,Fattended, with closures still in place
OL,13,Fon Tuesday morning.
